{
  "$id": "https://canonize.dev/schemas/guide-bundle.schema.json",
  "title": "CanonizeGuideBundle",
  "description": "Canonize agent-scan guide bundle, wire version 1. One feature's guide (synthesis + aspects + dives + front matter + deterministic facts) generated by /canonize:scan and POSTed to /api/guide. Rule refs are symbolic (\"rule:<idx>\"/\"cited:<idx>\"); anchors are \"path:line\" onto files the session actually read; codeAnchor convention is \"path::Symbol\".",
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
